	(text "U3: DIR is hard-wired HIGH; A pins are inputs, B pins are outputs. /OE is LOW." (at 18 18 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "e5248695-5ca5-5e97-bd7b-ac43879da5f1"))
	(text "Direct sync: IDE37 -> U3.8/12 -> FPGA15; IDE38 -> U3.9/11 -> FPGA16. Independent of mux SEL." (at 18 27 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "2f72651d-fd56-582f-b70a-587300b2a9cb"))
	(text "U8/U11: VCCA=3.3V, VCCB=5V; outputs isolated with either rail absent. U7 NAND gives active-high MISO_EN." (at 18 264 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "f7fc6ebe-dd95-5a57-a687-43d451f0c705"))
	(text "U11 -> R19 1k -> IDE15: overlap <=5.56mA, IRQ LOW <=0.67V. Bus capacitance <=100pF; qualify mode settling." (at 18 201 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "684dfeff-5bd1-58b6-a846-2deb79fbecfd"))
	(text "R2/R3 are on the 5V HOST side. R9 holds the separate Tang interrupt source HIGH." (at 18 256 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "eb5192db-d803-50c3-9936-6b312482695f"))
